      "artist": "Phil Richards from London, UK",
      "description": "Manx Electric Railway no.2 is seen at Ramsey on 29 July 2017 having arrived in on the 16:40 from Derby Castle. Having arrived with trailer no.43 on the right hand track, the trailer is pushed back  beyond the points on the other line. The guard then puts the handbrake on the trailer whilst the driver shunts the powered vehicle over. The trailer then rolls back in under gravity prior to the powered vehicle crossing back over before backing on to the trailer.",
