      "artist": "Phil Richards from London, UK",
      "description": "\"Toast rack\" style car no.33 and trailer seen at Ramsey on the evening of 29 July 2017 prior to departure with the 19:40 to Derby Castle. Late in the evening and not the warmest of July evenings, this was quite a drafty run back as far as South Cape.",
